[h1]
[ 1. 1. 5 ]
[/h1]

Below are more details on what's coming for Protocol:null

[h2]News[/h2]
[list]
[*] Possibility to spawn the BtB Upgrade;
[*] Possibility to spawn upgrades for the car;
[*] Traps cooldown;
[*] Destruction of scenery items;
[*] Lore information;
[*] New sounds for menus and scenery;
[*] Randomization of scenario items, including:
[olist]
[*] Trees;
[*] Grass;
[*] Advertising boards;
[*] Landmines;
[/olist]
[/list]

[h2]Character Updates[/h2]
[list]
[*] Weapon weight now impacts character movement;
[*] Mouse scroll changes weapons;
[*] Kneeslide cooldown sound;
[*] New quotes for K-12;
[/list]

[h2]Enemies Updates[/h2]
[list]
[*] [Replicants] - Randomization of skin color patterns;
[*] [Mines] - Added landmines throughout the scenery;
[/list]

[h2]Graphics updates[/h2]
[list]
[*] Improvements to scenery models and textures;
[*] Enhancements to the particle system;
[*] More detailed interactions with the scenery;
[/list]

[h2]Menus updates[/h2]
[list]
[*] [General] - Return sound;
[*] [General] - Confirm sound;
[*] [General] - Partial support for controllers;
[*] [General] - Inputs auto-detection;
[*] [General] - Visual coherence improvements;
[*] [First login] - Enable or disable input auto-detection;
[*] [Play game] - Quotes 'Ready' for K-12;
[*] [Play Game] - New flow;
[*] [Select Maps] - New map selection menu;
[*] [Choose Char] - New character selection menu;
[*] [Loadout] - New loadout selection menu;
[*] [Checkout] - New checkout screen;
[*] [Checkout] - Ready sound;
[*] [Controls] - Change default input;
[/list]

[h2]Settings updates[/h2]
[list]
[*] Sensitivity adjustment for first-person aiming;
[*] HUD disable option;
[*] Input auto-detection;
[*] Display selection;
[*] V-Sync;
[/list]

Protocol Null's plan is to bring periodic updates, seeking to bring new content aiming to increase replayability for players and continuous improvement. This philosophy is also valid for the demo, with the feedback collected, adjustments were made and new items were added, below is the list of changes that were made in version 1.0.5.

[h1][ 1. 0. 5 ][/h1]
[h2]News [/h2]
[list]
[*]New attachment for VIT-0 [Fast Hands];
[*]New bullet type for AN-4 [Piercing];
[/list]

[h3]Balancing [/h3]
[list]
[*]Engineer life reduced to 80;
[*]General improvements in weapon acuracy;
[/list]

[h3]Chars updates[/h3]
[list]
[*]Improved AN-4 free shot animation;
[*]Engineer class skill animation;
[*]Fixed buy two primary weapon;
[*]New reload animations for T13 and MLU;
[*]New reload sounds for T13 and MLU;
[*]Improvements in the transition between animations;
[/list]

[h3]Movimentation updates[/h3]
[list]
[*]Jump in slide [In iddle];
[*]Improvements in camera when sliding;
[*]Improvements in camera transition;
[*]Improvements in car animation;
[*]Change time and speed of kneeslide;
[*]Added cooldown between kneeslides;
[*]Improvements in aim system;
[*]Increased aiming sensitivity;
[*]Improvements in jump responsibility;
[*]Improvements in jump animations;
[*]Added icon on slide start and end;
[/list]

[h3]Optimization updates[/h3]
[list]
[*]Two new graphics qualities [Low settings]; 
[/list]

[h3]Enemies updates[/h3]
[list]
[*][Replicants] Improvements in damage detection;
[*][Replicants] Improvements in attack car position;
[*][Replicants] Fixed bug dealing damage after death;
[*][Stuns] Now you able to destroy deadbody;
[/list]

[h3]Menus updates[/h3]
[list]
[*][Main Menu] - Added discord button;
[*][News] Added social midia buttons;
[*][Loadout] Improvements in attachment selection;
[*][Loadout] Shows itens in level MAX;
[*][Loadout] Added Transition Animation when you Ready;
[/list]

[h3]Settings updates[/h3]
[list]
[*]You can select the default input when logging into the game for the first time;
[/list]
